{"id":"18fee81c0ec38350","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-bar-induction.md","title":"Bar Induction","display":"df-bar-induction — Bar Induction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-bar-induction","aliases":["72-df-bar-induction"],"display":"df-bar-induction — Bar Induction","depends_on":["[[72-df-bar-theorem]]","[[72-df-coded-well-order]]","[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print272/PDF284; tree version explicitly separate","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-bar-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-bar-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bar-induction — Bar Induction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3615c7a093d0b56d\" href=\"?note=3615c7a093d0b56d\" title=\"72-df-bar-theorem\">72-df-bar-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33bb5f7820ca84c2\" href=\"?note=33bb5f7820ca84c2\" title=\"72-df-coded-well-order\">72-df-coded-well-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print272/PDF284; tree version explicitly separate"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,B,P\">\\(T,B,P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bar}_T,\\operatorname{Prog}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{Bar}_T,\\operatorname{Prog}_T\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3615c7a093d0b56d\" href=\"?note=3615c7a093d0b56d\" title=\"72-df-bar-theorem\">72-df-bar-theorem</a>。关系版本取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"33bb5f7820ca84c2\" href=\"?note=33bb5f7820ca84c2\" title=\"72-df-coded-well-order\">72-df-coded-well-order</a> 的对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)\\)</span>；A遍历基本L2全部公式，D,R为不自由出现在A中的集变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BI}_T(B,P):=(\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P))\\to()\\in P,\\qquad\\operatorname{BarInduction}(T):=\\forall B,P\\subseteq T\\ \\operatorname{BI}_T(B,P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BI}_T(B,P):=(\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P))\\to()\\in P,\\qquad\\operatorname{BarInduction}(T):=\\forall B,P\\subseteq T\\ \\operatorname{BI}_T(B,P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BI}_{\\rm rel}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)\\to\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)):A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(\\varnothing)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{BI}_{\\rm rel}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)\\to\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)):A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(\\varnothing)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式是元理论中树与子集上的命题，第二式是本书IV印刷p272的两类变量公式公理模式；不把这两个不同类型的BI默认为同一符号。关系版本允许任意公式A，在受限概括下不能只靠对集变量的归纳得到。若A含D/R参数，可先重命名新域、关系变量后保留这些参数；限制用于避免模式构造捕获。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bar-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"3615c7a093d0b56d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bar-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-coded-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"33bb5f7820ca84c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-coded-well-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bar-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"3615c7a093d0b56d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树 $T,B,P$、$\\operatorname{Bar}_T,\\operatorname{Prog}_T$ 如 [[72-df-bar-theorem]]。关系版本取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]] 的对象 $\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)$、$\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)$；A遍历基本L2全部公式，D,R为不自由出现在A中的集变量。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-coded-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"33bb5f7820ca84c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"树 $T,B,P$、$\\operatorname{Bar}_T,\\operatorname{Prog}_T$ 如 [[72-df-bar-theorem]]。关系版本取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]] 的对象 $\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)$、$\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)$；A遍历基本L2全部公式，D,R为不自由出现在A中的集变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,B,P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bar}_T,\\operatorname{Prog}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BI}_T(B,P):=(\\operatorname{Bar}_T(B)\\land B\\subseteq P\\land\\operatorname{Prog}_T(P))\\to()\\in P,\\qquad\\operatorname{BarInduction}(T):=\\forall B,P\\subseteq T\\ \\operatorname{BI}_T(B,P).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{BI}_{\\rm rel}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\operatorname{WF}(D,R)\\to\\operatorname{TI}_{D,R}(A)):A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_2(\\varnothing)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1647,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-bar-induction|df-bar-induction — Bar Induction]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-bar-induction|df-bar-induction — Bar Induction]]"},{"id":"d7c1a223707e577d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的元 $\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)$（P⊆D）；树上的Bar与BarInduction见 [[72-df-bar-induction]]。"}],"outgoing":["3615c7a093d0b56d","33bb5f7820ca84c2","5ae195683ce3beb4"]}